Simulation of machining process (cutting) by the SPH method in LS-DYNA. 
Full tutorial – 20 minutes. 
Our page in facebook https://www.facebook.com/lsdynatutorial

Description:
- the application of SPH method;
- the use of material models Johnson-Cook with accumulation of damage, the coefficients of destruction, the equation of state and the additional thermal parameters;
- consideration of the heating of the blank during the cutting process;
- use of contact with regard to thermal parameters of the process of interaction.

